Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal
Description: Keep your computer awake on request
 Kaeru is a lightweight desktop utility that asks the desktop to prevent
 automatic system sleep and screen blanking for a chosen duration or until
 turned off. Selecting a new duration replaces the current request.
 .
 It uses the desktop's own mechanisms (xdg-desktop-portal Inhibit with a
 logind fallback) and never synthesizes input activity or modifies global
 power-management settings. It is local-first: no accounts, no cloud, no
 telemetry.
 .
 The frog icon set is Kaeru's official visual identity.